    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, stomp on enemies, avoid the hostile creatures and water sources that are dangerous to the bubble guy, and reach the final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 levels in total. As you progress, you can unlock new skills and new skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, it\u2019s not difficult to complete the game, but some levels require a bit of skill. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, stomp on enemies, avoid the hostile creatures and water sources that are dangerous to the bubble guy, and reach the final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 levels in total. As you progress, you can unlock new skills and new skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, it\u2019s not difficult to complete the game, but some levels require a bit of skill. </p>",
